docs {
  # Transaction Status Callback
  
  Receives the result of a transaction status query.
  
  ## When Called
  After querying the status of a specific transaction.
  
  ## Information Provided
  - Transaction completion status
  - Transaction timing details
  - Amount and parties involved
  - Transaction reason
  
  **Note**: This is informational - used for reconciliation and tracking.
}
